                "text": "Farmers and ranchers in the Big First need certainty, not more red tape.\n\nThe @HouseAgGOP budget bill invests in crop insurance, updates reference prices, and strengthens export promotion programs.\n\nIt\u2019s a real step forward for agriculture and food security in Kansas and across rural America.",
