                "text": "After Congressional Democrats held a Farm Bill hostage last Congress, @HouseAgGOP fought to address some of the agriculture community\u2019s most pressing needs.\u00a0\n\nOur One Big Beautiful Bill delivers wins for Kansas agricultural producers by expanding crop insurance, updating reference prices, bolstering trade promotion programs, and funding ag research.",
