                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill delivers wins for the Big First:\n\n\u27a1\ufe0fInvests $60 billion in the farm safety net\n\u27a1\ufe0fStrengthens Medicaid for the most vulnerable populations\n\u27a1\ufe0fExtends the largest tax cuts in history\n\u27a1\ufe0fCodifies @POTUS\u2019 executive orders that strengthen our southern border\n\nI was proud to support the agenda that 77 million Americans voted for in November.",
