                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Our One Big Beautiful Bill strengthens Medicaid coverage and SNAP benefits for America\u2019s most vulnerable populations, like pregnant women, seniors, individuals with disabilities, and single moms with kids too young to attend school.\n\nEvery dollar from these programs sent to people who are in the country illegally or to able-bodied adults unwilling to join the workforce is a dollar taken from those who need it the most.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
