                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Our agricultural community needs a five-year Farm Bill that is long enough to provide certainty and short enough to respond to the times.\u00a0\n\nWhile my @HouseAgGOP colleagues and I delivered for farmers in the OBBBA by updating reference prices, expanding crop insurance, and overhauling the radical death tax, we still need to pass a five-year, comprehensive farm bill for our producers.",
