                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Big Beautiful Bill is a win for farmers, ranchers, and rural communities:\n\n\u27a1\ufe0fIncreases and permanently extends the Small Business Deduction\n\u27a1\ufe0fStrengthens the farm safety net\n\u27a1\ufe0fExpands crop insurance\n\u27a1\ufe0fProtects two million family farms from the death tax",
